config SENSORS_STK6D2X
	tristate "STK STK68210 ALS, Flicker sensor"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  If you say yes here, you get support for the STK STK68210.
	  This driver can also be built as a module.
	  If so, the module will be called flicker_sensor.

config FLICKER_ANTI_ALIASING
	bool "Flicker Anti-Aliasing"
	default y
	help
	  This module calculate frequency with multi samplerate of flicker sensor
	  It needs multiple samplerate settings in flicker sensor